  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Framework partnership between Sida HUM and IRC-UK for 2011-2013 (24   months), including country projects (7 projects in 8 countries), a    RRM (8,385,852 SEK) and a Camp Assistance Fund (11,879,957 SEK).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ramvatl mellan Sida och IRC-UK 2011-2013 (24 m&#xe5;nader) inkluderar      landprogrma (7 projekt i 8 l&#xe4;nder), Rapid Respons Mechanism           (8,385,852 SEK)och st&#xf6;d till flyktingl&#xe4;ger (11,879,957 SEK).</narrative>
  </description>
